CODV is an unofficial fan project, unaffiliated with Activision, Infinity
Ward, Rockstar Games or Take-Two Interactive. It contains no retail Call
of Duty or GTA V code, data, models, animation, sound or art; players
supply their own copies of GTA V (and, from phase F3, Modern Warfare 2).
ScriptHookV is not included: it is fetched from Alexander Blade's official
distribution (dev-c.com) and the ASI links against its SDK import library.

Modern Warfare 2 engine code: iw4L (Apache-2.0)
  CodVRuntime.dll compiles these crates of iw4L by vladtrc,
  https://github.com/vladtrc/iw4L, at the commit pinned in
  upstreams.lock.json: movement_iw4, weapon_iw4, playerstate_iw4, hud_iw4,
  trace_iw4, clipmap_iw4, math_iw4, asset_iw4, d3d9_decl, d3d9_state,
  anim_iw4, xmodel_runtime, and (in the setup's codv-mw2import tool)
  fastfile_iw4.
  tools/prepare_overlay.py copies them into build/overlay/iw4l and applies
  CODV's modifications from patches/iw4l/ (none today). No iw4L source is
  copied into this repository. rust/codv-engine also restates the player
  spawn state and pmove context values of iw4L's sim crate
  (sim/src/world.rs spawn_player_state, sim/src/step.rs pmove_context).
  Ported from iw4L with the changes noted in each file's header (F4a):
    rust/codv-mw2data/src/viewmodels.rs  asset_model model_skel /
        packed_vertex, asset_anim xanim_catalog, asset_material link map
    rust/codv-mw2data/src/iwd.rs         asset_iw4 iwi, asset_material
        material_images decode
    rust/codv-engine/src/viewmodel.rs    asset_anim clip_scheduler,
        render_anim viewmodel_controller / anim fpv / fpv_rig / fpv_present
        / view_sway, asset_game fpv_assembly
    rust/codv-mw2data/src/playeranim/    asset_anim animtree, atr_compile,
        playeranim_parse (F4b)
    rust/codv-engine/src/body.rs         sim player_anim_script and its
        calls in sim step / combat, render_anim remote_animation /
        remote_body (F4b)
    rust/codv-mw2data/src/hud.rs         asset_game menu_catalog font /
        menu capture (F5b)
    rust/codv-runtime/src/mw2hud.rs      hud weaponbar / ammo / chrome
        owner draws, draw2d text layout, damage_direction (F5b)
    rust/codv-mw2data/src/sounds.rs      asset_audio sound_catalog
        capture_iw4 (alias rows, loaded sounds, sound file edges) (F5a)
    rust/codv-engine/src/viewmodel.rs    asset_anim clip_scheduler
        notetrack crossings (F5a)
