Modern Warfare 2 weapon data: the player's own copy
  codv-mw2import reads the weapons from the player's installed Modern Warfare
  2 (zone/english/common_mp.ff, patch_mp.ff) on the player's machine and
  writes their numbers to <GTA>/CODV/mw2/weapons.json there (and their view
  models, character animation and sounds under <GTA>/CODV/mw2/). No MW2 file or
  value is stored in this repository or shipped in a release; data/mw2.json
  holds only CODV's own choices (loadout, GTA stand-in weapons, scale).
  The import inflates the zone with miniz_oxide (crates.io, MIT OR Zlib OR
  Apache-2.0, https://github.com/Frommi/miniz_oxide) and adler2 (crates.io,
  0BSD OR MIT OR Apache-2.0).

